Given I open an editor "ilv" for tip command "ilv" and arguments ""
And I set field "monat" to "3"
And I set field "datart" to "ist"
And I press button "bstart"
And I save the current editor 

Given I open an editor "ilv" for tip command "ilv" and arguments ""
And I set field "monat" to "3"
And I set field "datart" to "plan"
And I press button "bstart"
And I save the current editor 

Scenario: 6 Darstelung der Differenz aus kumulierten fixen und prop. Planwerten und kumulierter Ist-Wert
Given I open an editor "babx" from table "(EDS):(EDS)" with command "VIEW" for record "BABKSPLAN"
And I set field "sganmon" to "3"
And I set field "sgendmon" to "3"
Then field "ikum" has value "0.00" in row 1
Then field "pfixkum" has value "-8.71" in row 1
Then field "ppropkum" has value "8.71" in row 1
